<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Selected Section</title>
    <link href="style.css" rel="stylesheet"/>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Give+You+Glory&family=Inconsolata:wght@300&family=Tsukimi+Rounded&family=Yomogi&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
  
  <div id="instruction">
    <h1>
      Drawing Room
    </h1>
    <p id = "ins1">
      1. draw inside the selected section for maximum 5 minutes.<br>
      2. please have your drawing line(s) connect to the grey points inside the box.<br>
      The purpose of this instruction is to have a final drawing as congruous as possible.<br>
      3. click 'submit' button when you are done with drawing your section.<br>
      4. click 'save' button if you wish to download your drawing as a file.<br>
      5. have fun!!
      <br>
      6. Click on 'Gallery' to see your submitted section
    </p>
    </p>
  </div>
  
    <div id="submit-section">
      <button class="button" id="submit" disabled>Submit</button>
      <button class="button" id="save">Save </button>
    </div>
  <div>
    <p>
      go to combined page to select a section
    </p>
    
  </div>
  <div>
    <a href="/">Gallery</a>
  </div>

    <script type="text/javascript" src="/socket.io/socket.io.js"></script>
    <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/p5.js/1.1.9/p5.js"></script>
  
    <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
